"<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Rikuy · informe mensual de octubre de 2026 · IE 40123 Santa Rosa de Chivay</title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:14mm}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#0D2B33;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact}
h1{font-size:22pt;margin:0 0 2mm}h2{font-size:13pt;margin:6mm 0 2mm;break-after:avoid}.regla{border-top:3px solid #0D2B33;margin:3mm 0 4mm}
.kpis{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:3mm;break-inside:avoid}.kpi{flex:1 1 30%;border:2px solid #0D2B33;padding:3mm}.kpi b{display:block;font-size:22pt;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
